<form class="totalform help-on-hover help-box" data-method="POST" data-route="/admin/settings/extensions"><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: logLevel;"><label for="field-UID">Extensions Log Level</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="logLevel" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value="debug">Debug</option><option value="info" selected>Info</option><option value="notice">Notice</option><option value="warning">Warning</option><option value="error">Error</option><option value="critical">Critical</option><option value="alert">Alert</option><option value="emergency">Emergency</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Minimum severity written to <code>logs/extensions.log</code> for extension events and extension-emitted log messages. Set to <code>debug</code> while developing or troubleshooting an extension.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: profileSampleRate;"><label for="field-UID">Performance profiling (1 in N requests)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="profileSampleRate" inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="50" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Production only. 0 disables profiling entirely. 50 samples 1 in 50 requests. 1 profiles every request. Development and preview always profile fully.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: budgetMsPerExtension;"><label for="field-UID">Per-extension slow warning (ms / request)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="budgetMsPerExtension" inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="200" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Warn when a single extension adds more than this many milliseconds to a request. 0 disables the warning.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: budgetMsPerStack;"><label for="field-UID">Total extension slow warning (ms / request)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="budgetMsPerStack" inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="500" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Warn when all extensions combined add more than this many milliseconds to a request. 0 disables the warning.</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form>